# WHITELIST, deliberately. ~/NotesIndex holds the full personal Apple Notes
# database (NoteStore.sqlite, ~112MB) and every exported note under output/.
# Ignore everything by default so no note content can ever be committed by
# accident; add new tracked files explicitly below.

*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!run_combined_export.sh
!run_with_terminal.sh
!test_time_logic.sh
!docs/
!docs/*.md
!launchd/
!launchd/*.plist
!launcher/
!launcher/*.c
!launcher/*.sh
